Written by Deadcode, with contributions from tcclaviger (the N-rank all-reduce kernels), ggz14
(the MXFP4 GEMM, the A-tiled MXFP4 prefill GEMM and the GDN kernels' overflow guards), slydlake
(the MXFP4 decode and prefill GEMMs and the MXFP4 linear, stop strings after the reasoning block,
and the draft refill on a prefix hit), goodman-b (four-rank tensor parallelism
for Qwen3.8-Flash-Next), keptn42 (the four-rank all-reduce served in place, the fused four-rank
writes, the n-gram table in RAM, the four-class expert split, the Grafana dashboard, the routed
GEMM's decode loads and run search, the gated residual's prefill read form and row groups, and
the fused router launch), mechkbfan (the token embedding in the pinned host pool), Code000 (the
n-gram gather on the card and the MTP head's history-pass skip) and baKon (three-rank tensor
parallelism, serving any world size from the shipped container, and the request log).

